=== 2025-01-XX: Add SN Click Highlighting Feature ===

User Request:
如果點擊右邊 parsed section sn 組, 右邊的 parsed section 與 raw section 同一組都亮藍色; 
如果我點擊右邊 raw section sn 組, 右邊的 parsed section 與 raw section 的 sn 組都亮藍色; 
而兩種情形下左邊的同一節同一組 sn 亮橘色

如果點左邊一節中的某 sn 組, 左藍, 右邊 parsed, raw, section 都亮橘色.

Summary:
Implement bidirectional SN click highlighting similar to dual_reader_right_editor:
- Click right Parsed section SN → Right (Parsed + Raw) blue, Left orange
- Click right Raw section SN → Right (Parsed + Raw) blue, Left orange  
- Click left SN → Left blue, Right (Parsed + Raw) orange

Color scheme:
- Clicked element (local): Deep blue (#1e88e5)
- Corresponding elements (remote): Orange (#ff9800)

